  "guardrails": [
    "Every listed surface is internal and does not authorize publication.",
    "Every product page must map to exactly one canonical product and to COMMERCIAL_RELEASE_STATE_v1.json.",
    "A broader product must not be positioned as necessary when a smaller product already satisfies the stated need.",
    "The diagnostic is the only surface allowed to contain form controls and it must remain fully local, non-persistent and non-submitting.",
    "No surface may contain price, checkout, lead capture, external tracking, artificial scarcity or guaranteed outcomes.",
    "JPN Pro Kit must remain presented as EM PREPARAÇÃO while canonical release dependencies are open.",
    "JPN Gestão Fácil remains a managerial aid and does not replace accounting, banking, fiscal systems, ERP or audit."
  ]
